1
00:00:00,515 --> 00:00:02,985
(Alfred:)Leonard, if you don't mind,
I-I think I'm a little tired.

2
00:00:02,984 --> 00:00:04,184
(Alfred:)I'm gonna call it a night.

3
00:00:04,185 --> 00:00:05,685
(Leonard:)Sure, Dad.

4
00:00:05,686 --> 00:00:07,556
(Alfred:)I'm a little
tuckered out myself,

5
00:00:07,555 --> 00:00:09,685
(Mary:)so I will see you all
in the morning.

6
00:00:10,725 --> 00:00:12,225
(Alfred:)Would you like
to share a cab?

7
00:00:12,226 --> 00:00:13,426
(Mary:)That would be fine.

8
00:00:13,427 --> 00:00:15,057
(Alfred:)Where are you staying?
I'm at the Westin.

9
00:00:15,062 --> 00:00:16,292
(Alfred:)Oh, so am I.

10
00:00:16,297 --> 00:00:17,627
(Alfred:)Can I interest you
in a nightcap?

11
00:00:17,632 --> 00:00:20,062
(Mary:)I think that you could.

12
00:00:24,805 --> 00:00:27,075
(Leonard:)What is happening there?

13
00:00:27,074 --> 00:00:29,604
(Sheldon:)I think it's pretty obvious.

14
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:31,940
(Sheldon:)They don't want dessert
'cause they filled up on bread.

15
00:00:40,612 --> 00:00:42,412
(Sheldon:)She's still not answering.

16
00:00:43,615 --> 00:00:46,615
(Leonard:)My father's not texting me back.

17
00:00:48,453 --> 00:00:51,623
(singsongy): 'Cause they both
turned their phones off.

18
00:00:56,661 --> 00:00:59,801
(Sheldon:)I don't like this at all.

19
00:00:59,798 --> 00:01:01,428
(Leonard:)I don't like it either.

20
00:01:01,433 --> 00:01:02,703
(Mary:)Really?

21
00:01:02,701 --> 00:01:04,771
(laughing):
'Cause I love it.

